# BEACON AI SME PLATFORM
# PRODUCT & FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS

This file defines WHAT the product must do.

The separate engineering rules define HOW the product must be built.

This file is based on the agreed Beacon Service Contract and the Technical Proposal. It must be treated as the functional source of truth unless Beacon approves a change in writing.

