==================================================
14. RECEIPTS & INVOICES
==================================================

Users must be able to attach receipts/invoices to relevant financial records.

Mobile users should be able to capture/upload documents from a phone.

Receipt/invoice functions should support:

- upload/capture;
- secure preview;
- secure download where permitted;
- linkage to related transaction;
- OCR processing;
- extracted-value review.

Private financial documents must never become public files.

==================================================
15. OCR FUNCTIONALITY
==================================================

OCR must support extracting suggested values from receipts and invoices where document quality and language support permit.

The workflow must be:

Upload/capture document
-> process OCR
-> show extracted suggestions
-> user reviews
-> user corrects if needed
-> user confirms
-> only then may confirmed data be used for posting.

OCR should support, where technically available:

- Arabic numerals;
- Western numerals;
- relevant invoice/receipt text.

If OCR confidence is weak or extraction is incomplete, the result must remain visibly marked for review.

OCR must never silently create an authoritative transaction.

==================================================
16. AI-ASSISTED TRANSACTION CATEGORIZATION
==================================================

The system must support AI-assisted transaction-category suggestions.

AI must suggest from the configured/allowed category list.

The user must be able to:

- accept the suggestion;
- correct the suggestion;
- reject/replace the suggestion.

Uncertain results must remain marked for review.

The system should surface potential:

- duplicate records;
- missing information;
- unusual transactions;

for human checking rather than automatically modifying records.

