25. READINESS SCORING
==================================================

Readiness scoring must use Beacon-approved rules.

The rule model must support at least the concepts of:

- criterion;
- weight;
- mandatory condition;
- treatment of missing data;
- version.

Users must be able to understand the basis of the assessment rather than receiving an unexplained score.

A readiness score supports advisory work and referral preparation.

It must NOT be presented as a financing approval.

