58. MANDATORY ACCEPTANCE SCENARIOS
==================================================

### Financial accuracy

A predefined sample ledger must reconcile correctly with reports and exports, including:

- credit transactions;
- partial payments;
- corrections.

### Configurable requirements

An administrator can update a requirement without a code release, while an earlier assessment retains its original rule/version.

### Consent and access

A referral cannot be released without required consent.

Unrelated users cannot access referral records/documents.

### AI behavior

Users can correct AI suggestions.

Unsupported questions escalate appropriately.

Manual workflows remain usable during AI-service interruption.

### Offline collection

Reconnection does not create duplicates or silently overwrite conflicting changes.

### Performance

