13. Any TODO: BUSINESS DECISION REQUIRED items.

Then implement only the confirmed scope.

==================================================
71. FINAL PRODUCT PRINCIPLE
==================================================

The product must connect the enterprise journey from profile to financing referral while remaining simple enough for non-technical SME users and structured enough for Beacon to manage, assess, monitor, and support participating enterprises.

The user experience should be simple.

The business records should be structured.

The financial calculations should be deterministic.

The AI should be assistive.

The access controls should be strict.

The history should be auditable.

The requirements should be configurable where Beacon needs ongoing control.

The application must not invent decisions that belong to Beacon.
